  "description": "A .NET 6 open-source framework for constructing future-proof-scalable abstract event-driven modular systems. Originally started as a simple project to demonstrate a basic implementation of Microsoft's .NET Managed Extensibility Framework (MEF). It has since evolved beyond MEF, into an advanced framework designed to simplify building cross-platform, event-driven, plugin-based, scalable, and modular applications using .NET and platforms that support .NET 6 class libraries.",
